{"quest_id": 8459, "name": "静かな街", "description": "王子たちは辺境大監獄に最も近い街へ到着。\n普段と違い、静まり返った街中に違和感を\n覚える一行に隠れていた囚人が襲い来る！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "スティールシティ・マーダーズ", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920225, "map_no": 9286, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 200, "gold": 850, "drops": [{"card": 50, "c": 1}, {"card": 3, "c": 2}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 235, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2158400, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 38483, "global_id": 12100}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 220, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 220, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_range": 280, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 237, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145136, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1415, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 36279, "global_id": 9896, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 12000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 12000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 1, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145152, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 1, "master_id": 36280, "global_id": 9897, "variants": [{"hp": 12000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 12000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 1, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145168, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1090, "master_id": 36281, "global_id": 9898}], "spawn_sec": 44}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 21, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 100, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 100, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145184, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 1, "master_id": 36282, "global_id": 9899, "variants": [{"tags": ["植物"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 100, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 100, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2145200, "special_effect_id": 1416, "master_id": 36283, "global_id": 9900}], "spawn_sec": 52}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ピーク", "text": "――ここが、辺境大監獄に一番近い街です。", "face": "u2344a1"}, {"name": "アイゼルフ", "text": "職員さんたちのベッドタウンですね。\nワタシたちも時々、警らで来るんですけど……。", "face": "u2343a1"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "やけに静かだな……。\n酒場もあるけど、物音ひとつしねェ。", "face": "u2206a1"}, {"name": "アイゼルフ", "text": "全員避難できたんでしょうか……？", "face": "u2343a1"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "いいや、こういう時は――", "face": "u2206a1"}, {"name": "シルヴァーナ", "text": "えぇ、こういう時は――", "face": "u2064a1"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "――でてきやがれ！\nそこにいるのは分かってんぞ！！", "face": "u2206a1"}, {"name": "シルヴァーナ", "text": "――でてきなさい！\n穴だらけの酒樽になりたくなかったら！！", "face": "u2064a1"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "なんだこいつらぁぁぁぁッ！？\n所構わず乱射し始めやがったぁぁぁッ！！", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "シルヴァーナ", "text": "失礼ですね！\nちゃんと狙ってますよ！", "face": "u2064a1"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "バレバレなんだよ！\n待ち伏せするつもりならもっと上手くやりやがれ！", "face": "u2206a1"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "さぁ王子様、出番だぜ！！", "face": "u2206a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "囚人", "text": "ひぃぃぃっ！？\n命だけはぁぁぁぁ！！", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "デステリカ", "text": "ったく、命が惜しいなら脱走なんてするなよなァ。", "face": "u2206a1"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "そ、それは……。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "アイゼルフ", "text": "主犯格は分かっています。\nあの男に焚き付けられたのでしょう？", "face": "u2343a1"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "…………ああ、そうだ。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "反乱に協力しなかったら、\n俺たちも、いったいどうなっていたことか……。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "アイゼルフさん、その「男」というのは……？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アイゼルフ", "text": "名前は、誰も知りません。\nある日から、毎夜連続で惨殺死体が発見されて……。", "face": "u2343a1"}, {"name": "アイゼルフ", "text": "新聞に載った名前が、そのまま通称になったんです。\n連続切り裂き魔――ザ・リッパーって。", "face": "u2343a1"}, {"name": "ピーク", "text": "警備部隊にも多数の被害が出ましたが、\nどうにか逮捕し、今は辺境大監獄に収監されています。", "face": "u2344a1"}, {"name": "ピーク", "text": "おそらく、今回の反乱における、\n主犯格であると思われます。", "face": "u2344a1"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "あいつは……不気味なやつなんだ……。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "いつも誰かを、まるで視線で切り刻むみてぇに\nじろじろと見つめていやがって……。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "皆、噂してた。\nあいつは、ただ見つめているんじゃない。\n頭ン中で、切り刻む想像をしているんだって。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}, {"name": "囚人", "text": "だから、監獄には存在しないはずのナイフを\nあいつが手にした時、俺たちに、\n逆らうなんて選択肢はなかったんだよ……。", "face": "lc095775b72d4"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920225_9286", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 885, "y": 536}, {"k": "m", "x": 812, "y": 359, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 732, "y": 398, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 592, "y": 487, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 662, "y": 446, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 408, "y": 199, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 345, "y": 241, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 270, "y": 282, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 375, "y": 351, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 446, "y": 303, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 519, "y": 260, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 626, "y": 331, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 554, "y": 369, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 487, "y": 418, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 820, "y": 448, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 747, "y": 501, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 189, "y": 325, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 322, "y": 135, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 253, "y": 180, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 180, "y": 223, "id": 218}, {"k": "r", "x": 376, "y": 431, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 236, "y": 357, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 100, "y": 257, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 714, "y": 294, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 465, "y": 148, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 499, "y": 510, "id": 305}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "The Quiet Town", "description_en": "The Princes arrive at the town closest to the Frontier Grand Prison.\nFeeling an unease in the unusually silent streets, a hidden Prisoner attacks them! Advanced (★1 acquisition guideline: Avg Lv10)"}